{
  "_comment": [
    "Spike fixture, the small case. Same adaptations as card-processing.json:",
    "'_comment' keys are additive and not part of the ADR-0001 node shape or",
    "envelope, and the file is pretty-printed rather than canonical.",
    "Shape: 16 blocks, maximum nesting depth 4 (root = depth 1). Every block type",
    "here except myapp.signup_step / myapp.notify / myapp.provision is core.*, and",
    "every datamodel path in a 'cond' resolves in ../datamodel.json.",
    "This document is the 'does the canvas still look right when there is almost",
    "nothing on it' fixture.",
    "Two block types here are PROPOSED and not shipped, both in js/proposed-",
    "core.js:",
    "  core.raise - the send half of the send -> interrupt wiring (sb-cy5). The",
    "  otherwise arm of the plan branch raises signup.abandoned, and the rail of",
    "  the group the branch sits in catches it. The two are not joined by an edge;",
    "  they name the same event, and the innermost enclosing group is what catches",
    "  it. The verify group further up names the same event on its own rail, which",
    "  is a second scope rather than a second catcher for this raise.",
    "  core.send (sb-ajr) - the same wiring with a CLOCK in it. The first block in",
    "  the onboarding group arms signup.abandoned for PT2H, so the group has two",
    "  senders of one event feeding one rule: the raise, immediately, when no plan",
    "  matches, and the delayed send, later, when nobody finished. Nothing joins",
    "  either card to the rail; all three name the same string.",
    "  Worth reading beside core.timeout: a delayed send caught by a rail is the",
    "  long-hand of what a timeout rule says in one card. Both forms are in the",
    "  spike on purpose, and which one the vocabulary should keep is Phase B's."
  ],
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "bdoc_signup_demo",
  "revision": 8,
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Signup wizard",
    "description": "Collect an account, verify the email, branch on the chosen plan, and provision.",
    "domain": "signup"
  },
  "root": {
    "type": "core.sequence",
    "id": "blk_su_root",
    "type_version": 1,
    "slots": {
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "myapp.signup_step",
          "id": "blk_su_account",
          "type_version": 1,
          "config": {
            "invoke_type": "myapp:signup",
            "step": "account",
            "label": "Collect email and password"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "core.group",
          "id": "blk_su_verify",
          "type_version": 1,
          "slots": {
            "body": [
              {
                "type": "myapp.signup_step",
                "id": "blk_su_send_verification",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "invoke_type": "myapp:signup",
                  "step": "send_verification",
                  "label": "Send the verification email"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "core.wait",
                "id": "blk_su_verify_wait",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "duration": "PT24H"
                }
              }
            ],
            "interrupts": [
              {
                "type": "core.on_event",
                "id": "blk_su_verified",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "event": "signup.email_verified",
                  "outcome": "resume"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "core.on_event",
                "id": "blk_su_abandoned",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "event": "signup.abandoned",
                  "outcome": "abandon"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "core.group",
          "id": "blk_su_onboarding",
          "type_version": 1,
          "slots": {
            "body": [
              {
                "type": "core.send",
                "id": "blk_su_onboarding_deadline",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "event": "signup.abandoned",
                  "delay": "PT2H",
                  "label": "Give onboarding two hours"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "core.branch",
                "id": "blk_su_plan",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "arms": [
                    {
                      "slot": "arm_business",
                      "cond": "signup.plan == 'business' AND signup.seats > 1"
                    },
                    {
                      "slot": "arm_personal",
                      "cond": "signup.plan == 'personal' AND signup.email_verified"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "slots": {
                  "arm_business": [
                    {
                      "type": "myapp.signup_step",
                      "id": "blk_su_company",
                      "type_version": 1,
                      "config": {
                        "invoke_type": "myapp:signup",
                        "step": "company_details",
                        "label": "Collect the company details"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "arm_personal": [
                    {
                      "type": "myapp.signup_step",
                      "id": "blk_su_preferences",
                      "type_version": 1,
                      "config": {
                        "invoke_type": "myapp:signup",
                        "step": "preferences",
                        "label": "Ask about preferences"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "otherwise": [
                    {
                      "type": "myapp.notify",
                      "id": "blk_su_plan_help",
                      "type_version": 1,
                      "config": {
                        "invoke_type": "myapp:notify",
                        "template": "choose_a_plan",
                        "label": "Nudge them to pick a plan"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "core.raise",
                      "id": "blk_su_raise_abandoned",
                      "type_version": 1,
                      "config": {
                        "event": "signup.abandoned"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "myapp.provision",
                "id": "blk_su_provision",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "invoke_type": "myapp:provision",
                  "label": "Create the workspace"
                }
              }
            ],
            "interrupts": [
              {
                "type": "core.on_event",
                "id": "blk_su_onboarding_abandoned",
                "type_version": 1,
                "config": {
                  "event": "signup.abandoned",
                  "outcome": "abandon"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
